@@@!atrep

@@/ at-rst: a syntax mapper between a useful subset of
@@/ reStructuredText and atrep. Flat family (no list containers);
@@/ richer than at-markdown: definition items, field lists,
@@/ admonitions, and first-class footnotes (deixis callouts).
@@/ Inline and block literals map to the core enlexis forms,
@@/ images to enmedia. Connected to at-html by explicit .hom
@@/ files; everything else composes transitively.

@=== heading-1
@# grammata #@
@"level-1 heading (= underline); flat, does not nest content"@
===@

@=== heading-2
@## grammata ##@
@"level-2 heading (- underline)"@
===@

@=== heading-3
@### grammata ###@
@"level-3 heading (~ underline)"@
===@

@=== heading-4
@#### grammata ####@
@"level-4 heading (^ underline)"@
===@

@=== heading-5
@##### grammata #####@
@"level-5 heading (double-quote underline)"@
===@

@=== heading-6
@###### grammata ######@
@"level-6 heading (apostrophe underline)"@
===@

@=== emphasis
@* grammata *@
@"emphasis (*text*)"@
===@

@=== strong
@** grammata **@
@"strong emphasis (**text**)"@
===@

@=== link
@>< grammata ><@
@"hyperlink reference with embedded URI; the grammata is the displayed URL"@
@""
The visible-URL link, `URL <URL>`_ in RST. Hidden-href
references (`text <url>`_ with text distinct from the URL) are
deferred pending F9; the endomorphosis meanwhile projects them
as prose text with the visible URL beside it. Bare URLs in
prose stay prose.
""@
===@

@=== blockquote
@>
grammata
>@
@"block quotation (indented block)"@
===@

@=== unordered-item
@-
grammata
-@
@"bullet list item (- marker); items form flat runs"@
===@

@=== ordered-item
@.(taxis)
grammata
.@
@"enumerated list item (N. marker); items form flat runs"@
===@

@=== definition-item
@:: lemma
grammata
::@
@"definition list item; the lemma is the term"@
===@

@=== field
@: lemma
grammata
:@
@"field list entry (:Name: value); the lemma is the field name"@
===@

@=== note
@!
grammata
!@
@"note admonition (.. note::)"@
===@

@=== warning
@!!
grammata
!!@
@"warning admonition (.. warning::)"@
===@

@=== footnote
@^
grammata
^@
@"footnote body (.. [#name]); attached by deixis callouts"@
===@
